ui-contained-has-an-expressive-look-and-feel-it-uses-a-filled-container-to-separate-a-search = 带容器：具有富有表现力的外观和体验。它使用填充容器将搜索栏与建议或结果列表分隔开

ui-divided-baseline-doesn-t-have-the-latest-visual-style-motion-or-flexibility = 分隔式（基线）：不具备最新的视觉样式、动效或灵活性

ui-the-contained-style-has-a-persistent-filled-container-expressive-motion-and-rounded-shape = 带容器样式具有常驻的填充容器、富有表现力的动效和圆角形状

ui-the-divided-baseline-style-uses-a-divider-to-separate-the-search-bar-from-suggestions-and = 分隔式（基线）样式使用分隔线将搜索栏与建议和结果分隔开

ui-search-suggestions-and-results-appear-in-customizable-lists-with-two-layout-options-full-s = 搜索建议和结果显示在可自定义的列表中，有两种布局选项：全屏和停靠式。

